false,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"text-and-image":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_09T11_24_58_420Z.png","image_width":350,"subtitle":"","title":"Finished edges","text":"<p>Complete your floor’s look with optional finished edges. The edges <em>“snap”<\/em> into place using the same interlocking system as the dance flooring tiles and provide a clean, beveled border around your dance floor.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"text-and-image2":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_09T11_26_54_262Z.png","image_width":400,"subtitle":"","title":"WHEELED CART STORAGE","text":"<p>Pair large text with an image to tell a story, explain a detail about your product, or describe a new promotion.Specially designed cart for safe and convenient storage of your portable floor, minimal space required! A perfect tool to store and transport the 21′ X 21′ dance floors <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"37afe09d-e6c1-4ab3-b02e-886b131010a1":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"simple and effective tiles","text":"<p>Attractive event flooring that is easy to install.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Slate_Black_Tap_Studio.webp","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":650,"framed":true,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-0":{"type":"heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Simple Installation"}},"template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-1":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>In four simple and fast steps, you can have your surface fully installed in minutes or less.<\/p><p><strong>Getting Started<\/strong><\/p><p>The panels have two sides with female PowerLocks, and two sides with male PowerLocks. All tiles on any given installation should always have the female PowerLocks going in the same direction.<\/p><p><strong>Step One<\/strong><\/p><p>Begin the installation by laying down your first panel in any one corner and pointing the female PowerLocks in the two directions that additional panels are to be added.<\/p><p><strong>Step Two<\/strong><\/p><p>Place the next panel so that the male PowerLock line up over the top of the female loops on the first panel. It's important to make sure that the female PowerLocks are facing exactly the same direction as the first panel.<\/p><p><strong>Step Three<\/strong><\/p><p>Gently step along the joint of the two panels. You will hear and feel the PowerLocks snap into place as you go.<\/p><p><strong>Step Four<\/strong><\/p><p>Once the two panels are joined, repeat steps one through three remembering to keep the female PowerLocks aligned until your floor is complete. That's all there is to this easy-to-install flooring!<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-0","template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"testimonials":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"testimonials-0":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-1":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-2":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}}},"block_order":["testimonials-0","testimonials-1","testimonials-2"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Testimonials","align_text":"center","round_images":true,"color_background":"#f9f9f9","color_text":"#1c1d1d"}},"8dee5b19-f3b7-478f-9187-7d6dbce1c9ab":{"type":"hero-video","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"SNOW, MUD\n& DAMAGE","title_size":60,"subheading":"CONTAIN THEM WITH THE FLOOR DEFENDER","link_text":"","link":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-bottom horizontal-right","video_url":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/205bf0dd43474cadbc436af39a1133dd.mp4","overlay_opacity":0,"section_height":"650px","mobile_height":"auto"}},"f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"REGULAR VS PRO GRADE MATS"}},"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>The underside of Floor Defender Pro Garage Containment Mats features a tatami grain pattern for increased traction. This patterned backing prevents these mats from lifting and allows them to retain their shape over extended periods of time. Also, the tatami grain patterned backing produces a smoother, less wrinkled surface than the smooth backed regular Floor Defender Garage Containment Mats.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0","template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"9eabf97c-3b7e-48fd-99b4-d208e8951630":{"type":"background-image-text","custom_css":[".background-media-text__text {text-align: left; font-size: 1.1em; background: var(--shopify-editor-setting-color_body_bg); background: #ffffff00; padding: 40px; width: 1100px; margin-top: 350px; color: white;}",".h3,h3 {font-size: 60px;}"],"settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"HexaDeck Tile","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ezgif.com-gif-maker_14_81e1d120-e85e-4698-a7f2-55b3130740d6.jpg","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":550,"framed":false,"parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"1148b4e3-2cf6-42af-910e-9aa29caa2a70":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hex_deck_ae2008b6-2e6d-4ee4-a1ed-8e5a024cca9b.png","image_width":280,"subtitle":"","title":"extraordinary strength","text":"<p>Hexa Deck tile naturally offers extraordinary strength and versatility that avoids the structural weakness associated with square modules.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"f2f4d304-6a8f-48b3-a6cd-0466dc6e11bd":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ezgif.com-gif-maker_16_635624cf-02c0-4c91-b75c-6a4020ea273f.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Easy Storage","text":"<p><\/p><p>When not in use, HexaDeck tile can be stored compactly on pallets for easy transport and sections may be stored on standard pallets or in our specialized HexaDeck transport pallets.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"5897c35b-64b9-4178-846b-d9b5c6a7e1ab":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ezgif.com-gif-maker_15_2dac6ff2-f6f5-4a9e-80d2-5d68a1a772eb.jpg","image_width":400,"subtitle":"","title":"Ground protection","text":"<p><\/p><p>The HexaDeck tile system protects ground, people and property by distributing weight across multiple support ribs for heavy-duty disaster relief roadways and tactical shelter flooring.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"12ee58e8-5133-4e52-a73b-887b18d27f7f":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"ROLL OUT AND LAY DOWN","title":"HASSLE-FREE INSTALL","text":"<p>Incredibly easy to use, the floor defenders unlike some other garage containments mats come ready to use. The single piece construction allows you to simply roll the mat out and lay it on your floor.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ezgif.com-gif-maker_8.gif","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":550,"framed":false,"parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"3eb2f88f-12e5-4f87-aabb-ad99d885f103":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_38_17_168Z.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"GARAGE FLOOR PROTECTION MATS","title":"PROTECT AGAINST CHEMICALS","text":"<p>Keep oil, geese, anti-freeze, and other chemicals that may drain out of your car contained, and away from other possessions stored in the garage.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"9d8d2f29-27b5-4648-b084-5ca9f0b9964b":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_42_33_705Z.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Improved","title":"EASY CLEAN UP","text":"<p>Floor defenders are very easy to clean, simply drag the mat outside with all its contents and hose it down. In a matter of minutes, the mat is ready to be redeployed and used all over again.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"49e1522d-4e00-4356-91df-3d3dbada5a3e":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_45_06_105Z.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"SIMPLE & COMPACT STORAGE","text":"<p>Although the Floor Defender Mats can be used year round, some of our customers prefer to only have the mats out in the winter.<\/p><p>Storing these mats after winter is incredibly easy. Simply roll them back up into a compact size and store it way in your garage.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"e98b186a-cb19-48cb-8775-57d1b1ee5ebe":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Frequently Asked Questions"}},"c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/pages\/frequently-asked-questions-floor-defender-garage-containment-mats\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/pages\/frequently-asked-questions-floor-defender-garage-containment-mats\"><strong>Got Questions? Learn more about our Floor Defender Garage Continment Mats ❗HERE<\/strong><\/a>❗<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1","c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"product-recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","setti